  "title": "Easy Awesome Shrimp Scampi",
  "description": "Buttery cracker crumbs, small salad shrimp, and a couple of pantry ingredients are all you need to make a simple version of shrimp scampi for a great appetizer or easy main dish.",
  "authors": [
